Added a view for certificates, made for the person who receives one: a card with the issue date, a button to download the file, with its type and size, and a button to check that the certificate is valid; a table of the values printed on the certificate; and the file's SHA-256 fingerprint, with a button to copy it. The verification page now has the same layout and also shows the fingerprint. Certificates and certificate templates also got icons, shown wherever Volto lists content, such as the contents view, the object browser and relation fields. @ericof
